A no-brainer gift during the festive season is, of course, a good bottle of alcohol. A bottle of wine or a premium label is often the go-to, but if you’re looking to go beyond the usual suspects, there’s plenty happening in India’s homegrown alcobev space.

With party season underway, now feels like the right time to dig out some of the standout homegrown spirits to put in front of guests or carry as gifts. If you’re inclined to pick the bottle nobody has seen before, at the link in bio, @gigglewater411 has an edit of Indian homegrown bottles you’ll want to consult.

